  "applications_text": "ECA 100KA1 is a pre-catalyzed version of methylhexahydrophthalic anhydride (MHHPA). It is a non-crystallizing anhydride curing agent for epoxy resins. ECA 100KA1 is used in epoxy laminating and filament winding applications. It is also used in electrical encapsulation applications where its excellent electrical properties are utilized. ECA 100KA1 is used in applications requiring UV resistance and alkaline resistance. It is used with a variety of epoxy resins including bisphenol A, bisphenol F, cycloaliphatic, novolac, and glycidyl ester epoxy resins.",
  "applications": [
    "Epoxy laminating",
    "Filament winding applications",
    "Electrical encapsulation",
    "Applications requiring UV resistance",
    "Applications requiring alkaline resistance",
    "Curing agent for bisphenol A epoxy resins",
    "Curing agent for bisphenol F epoxy resins",
    "Curing agent for cycloaliphatic epoxy resins",
