      "source_text": "ECA 100KA1 is a skin and eye irritant. Avoid contact with skin, eyes and clothing. Use only with adequate ventilation. In case of contact, immediately flush skin or eyes with plenty of water for at least 15 minutes; for eyes, get medical attention. Wash contaminated clothing before reuse."
